[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー……働いたー！\n２日間働き詰めで肩がカチコチ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whew... I'm beat! Two straight days of work and my shoulders are stiff as boards!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "始まったらあっという間でしたね。\nお客さんもたくさん来てくれてよかったです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It all went by so quickly once we started. I'm glad we had so many customers come by."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホント、ぜんぜん客足が途切れなくてさー。\n捌くの大変だったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No kidding. We didn't have a single lull in customers. It was tough keeping up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆の協力もあり、大きなトラブルもなく\n２日間の開催を終えることができた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to everyone's help, we've successfully concluded the two-day festival without any major issues."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "文化祭実行委員を代表して、感謝を申し上げる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "On behalf of the festival committee, I extend my gratitude to you all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これから後夜祭のキャンプファイヤーを行うが……\nその前に、来場者投票の結果を発表する！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll be holding the bonfire for the after-party soon... but before that, I'll announce the results of the visitor vote!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来た……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いよいよ決着の時ね。\nどちらが勝っても恨みっこなしよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The moment of truth has arrived. No hard feelings regardless of who wins."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000ああ……そういえば対決って話になってたっけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Oh... right, we were having a competition, weren't we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと！\u3000大事なことでしょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! That was the whole point!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやー……準備に追われてすっかり頭から抜けてた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... I was so caught up in the preparations that it completely slipped my mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、無事に完成してよかったよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I'm just glad everything came together in the end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだね。フロッケちゃんが倒れちゃった時は\nすごく心配したけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's true. I was really worried when Flocke collapsed, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来場者からの票を最も集めたのは――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The exhibit that received the most votes from visitors is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シャッフェン科学学校の留学生による、ＶＲカフェ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The VR Café by the exchange students from Schaffen Science Academy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおおおおーーーー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WOOOOOOOOAH!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "生徒たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Students"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "や……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったーーーーーー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WE DID IIIIIIT!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディさん！\u3000やりましたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi! We really did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……うん！\u3000",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、あれに負けるならしょうがないかなー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I guess if we had to lose to something, that was pretty amazing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "悔しいけれど……あの出来は認めるしか\nないでしょうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's frustrating, but... I have to admit their work was outstanding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあまあミミちゃん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There, there, Mimi..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、後夜祭を始めよう。\n各々、大いに楽しんでくれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let's begin the after-party. Everyone, enjoy yourselves to the fullest!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "改めてお疲れさま、フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks again for all your hard work, Flocke."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらこそ。お疲れさまでした、ハイディさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Likewise. Thank you for everything, Heidi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "途中はどうなることかと思ったけど……\nフロッケの夢、少しは叶ったかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wasn't sure how things would turn out halfway through... but do you think your dream came true, at least a little bit?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "十分すぎるくらいです。\n本当に、ありがとうございました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "More than enough. Thank you, truly, for everything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何より、目立った不具合も起きなくてよかったー\nテスト期間取れなくて不安だったんだよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm just glad we didn't have any major technical issues. I was worried since we didn't have much time for testing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディさんの丁寧なお仕事のおかげですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's all thanks to your meticulous work, Heidi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケの設計が良かったんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was your excellent design that made it possible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]